Subject: [PATCH 4/5] C1: brandImagery site contract + privileged
 set_site_brand_imagery op, seeded fleet-wide

Adds the site-level visual-identity contract (styleDescriptors, negativeDescriptors,
styleRef, seed/seedStrategy, loras, referenceArtifactIds) for AI image generation and
search, gated by a privileged set_site_brand_imagery patch op that mirrors
set_site_brand_tokens exactly (unreachable via set_site_fields or hand-authored
object_patch; discard/inverse handled generically via PRIVILEGED_PATCH_OPS). Fields
are bounded (capped array/string lengths) and the seedStrategy enum + loras shape
copy pdf-tool's image-model policy (#60) verbatim. Seeded into all three sites per
W16 P1 (drlurie: clinical-clean skincare editorial; platform: neutral professional
SaaS illustration; fernwell: warm botanical lifestyle), with drlurie's committed
production export kept in sync with its seed (drift-guard test).

